-- Every declaration in the in-scope text, in the order of the text.
GIVETH A LIST OF `Declaration of determinative status`
`the declarations of determinative status in the in-scope text` MEANS
    LIST
        (`s 4 (3): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 6 (8): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 73 (6): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 75 (4): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 75AA (3): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 75B (2): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 76 (3): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 77 (5): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 78 (2): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 79 (3): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 79A (4): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 81 (9): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 83 (2): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 84 (5): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 84A (5): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 86 (4): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 87 (4): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 88 (7): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 89 (11): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 91 (10): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 92 (2): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 93 (11): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 94 (3): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 95 (2): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 96 (5): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 120 (5): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 121 (5): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 126 (9): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 127 (7): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 132 (4): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 133 (4): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 134 (7): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 135 (6): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 146 (3): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 147 (8): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 151 (4): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 151A (3): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 151C (4): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 155 (2): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 170 (3): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)
        , (`s 171 (3): the section declares itself a determinative provision`)

-- src:111 | (2) A determinative provision is a provision of this Act that is declared to be a determinative provision.
-- src:112 | Example
@ref s 5 (2), (3) (src:111-112)
GIVEN id IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE `Determinative status`
`s 5 (2), (3): the determinative status of a section of this Act` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the declaration found for` id `the declarations of determinative status in the in-scope text`
    WHEN JUST declaration THEN
        CONSIDER declaration's `how far`
        WHEN `entirely` THEN JUST `a determinative provision`
        WHEN `so far as it applies to an applicable law or applicable provision` THEN JUST `a determinative provision so far as it applies to an applicable law or applicable provision`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN
        CONSIDER `the provision is in scope` id
        WHEN JUST inScope THEN
            IF   inScope
            THEN JUST `a non-determinative provision`
            ELSE NOTHING
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

GIVEN id IS A STRING, declarations IS A LIST OF `Declaration of determinative status`
GIVETH A MAYBE `Declaration of determinative status`
`the declaration found for` MEANS
    CONSIDER declarations
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
    WHEN first FOLLOWED BY rest THEN
        IF   first's `section` EQUALS id
        THEN JUST first
        ELSE `the declaration found for` id rest
